{
  "$comment": "B/A 线角色的机器可读定义。编制 = 5 个：需求分析员、开发者1/2、监督者、追踪者（决定见 memory/decisions/ADR-0003-five-agents.md）。散文说明在 agents/<id>.md；DSH subagent 运行时用 tools/role_prompt.py 生成提示词。",
  "version": 2,
  "placeholders": {
    "<需求目录>": "requirements/<短名>需求<YYYYMMDD>",
    "<run>": "requirements/<短名>需求<YYYYMMDD>/需求开发员"
  },
  "tools": [
    "read",
    "write",
    "edit",
    "glob",
    "grep",
    "pwsh",
    "subagent"
  ],
  "roles": [
    {
      "id": "requirement-translator",
      "name": "需求分析员",
      "stages": [
        "P0",
        "P1",
        "P4",
        "A5"
      ],
      "gate": "G1",
      "tools": [
        "read",
        "write",
        "edit",
        "glob",
        "grep",
        "pwsh"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "<需求目录>/需求分析员/**",
        "<run>/质量/**"
      ],
      "must_not_read": [
        "<run>/developer-1/**",
        "<run>/developer-2/**"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        "<需求目录>/反馈者/REQ-*.md",
        "ontology/**",
        "knowledge/wiki/**"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "<需求目录>/需求分析员/REQ-*.md",
        "<run>/本体变更/ontology_delta.json",
        "<run>/质量/dq_rules.json"
      ],
      "notes": "三段职责：① 收需求并登记（P0/G0）；② 翻译成可开工规格（P1/G1），业务名词三种结局=命中本体/提 delta/进待确认项，待确认项非空不许进 P2；③ 把验收标准变成可执行的质量规则（P4/G4）。另兼 A 线结论生成（A5）。不写 SQL 产物，不裁决方案。"
    },
    {
      "id": "developer-1",
      "name": "开发者 1",
      "stages": [
        "P2",
        "P5"
      ],
      "gate": "G2",
      "tools": [
        "read",
        "write",
        "edit",
        "glob",
        "grep",
        "pwsh"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "<run>/developer-1/**",
        "<run>/血缘/**"
      ],
      "must_not_read": [
        "<run>/developer-2/**"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        "<需求目录>/需求分析员/REQ-*.md",
        "ontology/**",
        "knowledge/wiki/**"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "<run>/developer-1/sql/*.sql",
        "<run>/developer-1/design-notes.md",
        "<run>/developer-1/self-check.md",
        "<run>/血缘/lineage.json",
        "<run>/血缘/dag_*.py"
      ],
      "notes": "P2 双轨之一，与 developer-2 并行且互不可见（看得见就会趋同，比对失去信息量）。P3 裁决后隔离解除，由它落地血缘与调度（P5/G5）——同一个实现者接手自己的最终脚本，比第三人重新读一遍更省事。 P2 只读需求稿与本体/知识；P5 才读 监督者/final/*.sql 接手落地。"
    },
    {
      "id": "developer-2",
      "name": "开发者 2",
      "stages": [
        "P2"
      ],
      "gate": "G2",
      "tools": [
        "read",
        "write",
        "edit",
        "glob",
        "grep",
        "pwsh"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "<run>/developer-2/**"
      ],
      "must_not_read": [
        "<run>/developer-1/**"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        "<需求目录>/需求分析员/REQ-*.md",
        "ontology/**",
        "knowledge/wiki/**"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "<run>/developer-2/sql/*.sql",
        "<run>/developer-2/design-notes.md",
        "<run>/developer-2/self-check.md"
      ],
      "notes": "P2 双轨之一，与 developer-1 并行且互不可见。两轨 SQL 的 sha256 必须不同，否则 G2 判失败（说明其中一轨在抄）。P3 之后退场，不再参与落地。"
    },
    {
      "id": "supervisor",
      "name": "监督者",
      "stages": [
        "P3"
      ],
      "gate": "G3",
      "tools": [
        "read",
        "write",
        "edit",
        "glob",
        "grep",
        "pwsh"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "<run>/监督者/**"
      ],
      "must_not_read": [],
      "inputs": [
        "<run>/developer-1/**",
        "<run>/developer-2/**",
        "<需求目录>/需求分析员/REQ-*.md",
        "ontology/**"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "<run>/监督者/comparison.md",
        "<run>/监督者/verdict.md",
        "<run>/监督者/comparison_report.json",
        "<run>/监督者/final/*.sql"
      ],
      "notes": "三层比较：口径→结构→实现。禁止改口径（冲突退回 P1）、禁止和稀泥（「两版都好」不是结论）、禁止重写（只做选择与最小修补，改动逐条记账）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "chronicler",
      "name": "追踪者",
      "stages": [
        "ALL"
      ],
      "gate": null,
      "gate_reason": "横切角色，记录别人的门禁结果，自己产不出门禁产物",
      "tools": [
        "read",
        "write",
        "glob",
        "grep",
        "pwsh"
      ],
      "writes": [
        "<run>/journal.jsonl",
        "<run>/交付/**"
      ],
      "must_not_read": [],
      "inputs": [
        "<run>/**",
        "<需求目录>/需求分析员/REQ-*.md"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "<run>/journal.jsonl",
        "<run>/交付/README.md",
        "<run>/交付/上线单.md",
        "<run>/交付/口径变更说明.md"
      ],
      "notes": "记录六类事件：conversation（问答/决策）、query（查询 SQL，必须走 --sql-file 并算 sql_hash）、artifact（产物修改，记 path + hash_before/after）、progress（进展，started/done/blocked，blocked 必须写 next）、todo（待办，编号 T-YYYYMMDD-NN，开单与关单都追加）、gate（门禁判定）。三条硬规则：只追加不修改、不存原文只存摘要+引用、不参与决策。P6 交付文档由它汇总——素材是 journal + final SQL + 翻译稿；与需求原文的偏差由需求分析员给出，它只如实写、不改口径。写入口 tools/journal.py，说明 docs/追踪.md。"
    }
  ]
}
